Notes: Every clear evening is kept; the featured one is chosen by a rule fixed in advance (closest
  to the median solar altitude among the clear sea-horizon evenings). The tiles live in raw/cop/
  (copied from data/dem/cache/cop/ on 2026-10-14); a .none marker means no tile, open sea.

Written by `fog build explain` from data/dip/mlo/dataset.json and the lock files: edit those, not this file.
